{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Companion twist: $z_a = e^{h\\varphi_a}$ scaling limit\n\nThe companion twist $C[z]$ has eigenvalues $z_a = e^{h\\varphi_a} \\to 1$ as $h\\to 0$, so **no conjugation alone** can produce $z_a \\to \\varphi_a$: conjugation cannot move eigenvalues. The group$\\to$algebra step $M \\mapsto (M-\\mathbb{1})/h$ does that, and the conjugation is what makes it finite (at $h=0$ the twist degenerates to a principal *unipotent*, so $(C-\\mathbb{1})/h$ diverges in the naive frame).\n\nThe right frame is the substitution $z = 1 + h v$ acting on the eigenvector $V(z) = (z^{N-1},\\dots,z,1)^T$:\n$$(G_h)_{kj} = \\binom{N-k}{N-j}\\, h^{\\,N-j}, \\qquad G_h = P \\cdot \\mathrm{diag}\\!\\left(h^{N-1},\\dots,h,1\\right),\\quad P_{kj}=\\binom{N-k}{N-j}.$$\nThe $h$-independent Pascal factor $P$ is the shift $z\\to z-1$; the diagonal factor is the principal grading $h^{-\\rho}$ (the usual XXX$\\to$Gaudin rescaling). Then, **exactly in $h$**,\n$$G_h^{-1}\\,C[z]\\,G_h = \\mathbb{1} + h\\, C\\!\\left[\\tfrac{z-1}{h}\\right],$$\nand with $z_a = e^{h\\varphi_a}$, since $(e^{h\\varphi_a}-1)/h \\to \\varphi_a$,\n$$\\lim_{h\\to0} \\frac{G_h^{-1} C[z] G_h - \\mathbb{1}}{h} = C[\\varphi].",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[cmpMat, gPasc, h, zz, ph];\n\n(* Companion matrix of Product[u - r] in the top-row convention {{e1, -e2, ...}, {1, 0, ...}, ...} *)\ncmpMat[roots_] :=\n    Module[\n        {n = Length[roots], u, c, m},\n        c = CoefficientList[Expand[Product[u - r, {r, roots}]], u];\n        m = ConstantArray[0, {n, n}];\n        m〚1〛 = -Reverse[Most[c]];\n        Do[m〚i, i - 1〛 = 1, {i, 2, n}];\n        m\n    ];\n\n(* Change of frame implementing z = 1 + eps v on V(z) = (z^(n-1), ..., z, 1):\n   Pascal shift z -> z - 1, then the principal grading diag(eps^(n-1), ..., 1). *)\ngPasc[n_, eps_] := Table[Binomial[n - k, n - j] eps^(n - j), {k, n}, {j, n}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## The $N=2$ case explicitly",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Module[{n = 2, zs, g, cc, conj, red},\n  zs = Table[zz[a], {a, n}];\n  g = gPasc[n, h];\n  cc = cmpMat[zs];\n  conj = Simplify[Inverse[g] . cc . g];\n  red = Simplify[(conj - IdentityMatrix[n])/h];\n  Grid[{\n    {\"C[z]\", MatrixForm[cc]},\n    {\"G\", MatrixForm[g]},\n    {\"G^-1 C[z] G\", MatrixForm[conj]},\n    {\"(G^-1 C[z] G - 1)/h\", MatrixForm[red]},\n    {\"companion of (z-1)/h\", MatrixForm[Simplify[cmpMat[(zs - 1)/h]]]}\n    }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"425396\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"4\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"0\" data-sub-end=\"12\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[4]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:12.5501em;vertical-align:-6.005em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.545em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.505em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.505em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:12.5101em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.005em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.505em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.535em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C[z]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.535em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.705em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.535em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"