  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Exact identity $G^{-1} C[z] G = \\mathbb{1} + h\\,C[(z-1)/h]$ at finite $h$, generic $z_a$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Grid[Prepend[\n  Table[Module[{zs = Table[zz[a], {a, n}], g = gPasc[n, h]},\n    {n, Simplify[Inverse[g] . cmpMat[zs] . g - (IdentityMatrix[n] + h cmpMat[(zs - 1)/h])] === ConstantArray[0, {n, n}]}],\n   {n, 2, 5}],\n  {\"N\", \"G^-1 C[z] G == 1 + h C[(z-1)/h]\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
