  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## The limit with $z_a = e^{h\\varphi_a}$ (here $N=4$, the su(4) case)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Module[{n = 4, phs, g, red, lim},\n  phs = Table[ph[a], {a, n}];\n  g = gPasc[n, h];\n  red = Together[(Inverse[g] . cmpMat[Exp[h phs]] . g - IdentityMatrix[n])/h];\n  lim = Map[Limit[#, h -> 0] &, red, {2}];\n  Grid[{\n    {\"h -> 0 limit\", MatrixForm[lim]},\n    {\"companion of phi\", MatrixForm[Simplify[cmpMat[phs]]]},\n    {\"equal?\", Simplify[lim == cmpMat[phs]]}\n    }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
