       "data": "Out[11]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{N} & \\text{A (C[z] - 1) B == C[(z-1)/h]  with  A = G\\^{}-1/h,  B = G}\\\\\\hline2 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline3 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline4 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline5 & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
